N5008 [expr.prim.fold] + [dcl.fct]/8: a fold-expression over the
function's own parameter pack inside its trailing-return-type
decltype.  CBMC fails the declaration with "found no match for symbol
'wrap'" (the trailing decltype cannot be evaluated, so the template
has no viable specialisation at the call).  11 lines, header-free,
accepted by g++/clang -std=c++17.  Found round 124 while kerneling
the cpp20_ranges_basic_libcxx auto layer; sibling shapes: a pack
expansion inside a braced-init-list in a trailing decltype fails the
same way (fw2 in /tmp/k124), while the parenthesised constructor-call
form works (fw6).
